  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Angaza: Help a Kenyan Student Receive an Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Angaza, which means illuminate in Swahili, is a program that provides underprivileged children with access to quality education and a brighter future. This is done through a comprehensive package that covers not just tuition, but also school supplies, transportation, uniforms, and mentorship. For just $1,500 per year or $6,000 for four years you can equip a student in need with the necessary tools to succeed. Join us in rekindling the flame of education and hope.</narrative>
  </description>
